  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.3.2 addresses repository inspection findings across the parser, formatters, CLI, build entry points, and tests.\nReuses the upload HTTP client, disposes request and response content, and materializes nullable signature inputs once.\nCorrects XML documentation and asynchronous resource disposal while retaining published APIs, synchronous parser tests, coverage gates, and JSON contracts.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.3.2.md",
